%% Generate Prescription Map Sequence
sequenceDiagram
    title Generate Prescription Map - CharAI Backend

    actor Farmer
    participant Frontend
    participant "Backend API" as API
    participant "Yield Prediction Engine" as Yield
    participant "Map Generator" as MapGen
    storage "File Storage" as Storage
    database Database

    note over Farmer,Yield: Generate yield-based prescription map
    Farmer->>Frontend: Click "Generate Map"
    Frontend->>API: POST /generate-map (field data)
    API->>Yield: Send coordinates, soil, slope, moisture
    Yield->>Yield: Run yield prediction model
    Yield-->>API: Return yield & ROI data
    API->>MapGen: Generate color-coded prescription map
    MapGen->>Storage: Save map file
    Storage-->>MapGen: Return map URL
    MapGen-->>API: Map generated successfully
    API->>Database: Store map metadata (URL, date)
    Database-->>API: Stored successfully
    API-->>Frontend: Send map URL + metadata
    Frontend-->>Farmer: Show result map and download link